    "开启后，这台 iPhone 会用安全隔区里的专属密钥给公开信息盖章。照片不会写入二维码，也不会上传。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When turned on, this iPhone will stamp public information with a unique key in the secure compartment. The QR code will not be written to the photo, nor will it be uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，這台 iPhone 會用安全隔區裡的專屬金鑰為公開資訊蓋章。照片不會寫入二維碼，也不會上傳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，这台 iPhone 会用安全隔区里的专属密钥给胶囊信息盖章。照片不会写入二维码，也不会上传。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once turned on, this iPhone will stamp the capsule information with a unique key in the secure compartment. The QR code will not be written to the photo, nor will it be uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，這台 iPhone 會用安全隔區裡的專屬金鑰為膠囊資訊蓋章。照片不會寫入二維碼，也不會上傳。"
          }
        }
      }
