    "灵动照片不仅是一款照片创作工具，也是一个透明、开放、持续维护的开源项目。项目不依靠出售用户数据或设置付费墙维持运行。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lingdong Photo is not only a photo creation tool, but also a transparent, open, and continuously maintained open source project. The project does not rely on selling user data or putting up paywalls to stay afloat."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
