    "项目源代码持续公开；照片识别、色彩分析与作品渲染均在设备本地完成。稳定的资源支持保障长期迭代，开源机制守护用户的知情权与创作自由。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The project source code continues to be made public; photo recognition, color analysis and work rendering are all completed locally on the device. Stable resource support ensures long-term iteration, and the open source mechanism protects users' right to know and freedom of creation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "專案原始碼持續公開；照片辨識、色彩分析與作品渲染均在裝置本地完成。穩定的資源支援保障長期迭代，開源機制守護使用者的知情權與創作自由。"
